<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $56-1/8 (FIM 258.78).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $56-1/8 (FIM 258.78).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR was unchanged at $56-1/8 in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 258.78 markka. In Helsinki on Friday Nokia A closed flat at 257.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) rose $0-1/8 to $32-5/8 on Wall Street on Friday. The price equals about 75.21 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed flat at 76.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR ended unchanged at $18 in New York. In Helsinki, Rauma rose 0.50 to 87.50 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
